  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (201-C, 202-C, Eco Technical Services Ltd Self-Contained Vehicle Wash Systems, Covering Letter dated 11 January 2012 Received 12/01/2012, 560006 Received 21/02/2012 and Viability Assessment Study Received 03/07/2012) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - Activities associated with the sale and exchange of motor vehicles shall not take place anywhere on the site except within the building.",
    "Condition : 4 - The use hereby permitted for the storage, preparation and viewing of cars for sale by finance arrangements shall not be carried on outside the following times: 09:00-19:00 Monday-Friday, 09:00-18:00 Saturdays, 10:00-16:00 Sundays, Bank and Public Holidays.",
    "Condition : 5 - Delivery of motor vehicles to the site shall only be undertaken to the rear of the premises within the allocated service yard for this unit and at no time other than during the permitted hours of operation for the hereby approved use."
  ],
